  "contracts": [
    "Whole ordinary C RestoreMapCommit reused from numbered Unit01022.c. MapCommitComplete forwarding wrapper is not counted.100 direct Native targets have canonical C owners.",
    "EA1870 city overlay stride49D8 and14 observed offsets are asserted. Withdraw arrays/cursor bind actual city. Finance marshals only2 fields touched by real leaf under active==1/editor!=1.",
    "All237 Native20-byte definition rows were read through Ghidra. Their first DWORDs equal existing normalized BYTE sizes0..6; discarded upper bytes all zero. Other fields are not inferred.",
    "Resource605A0C and finance605A3C editor gates remain distinct. Native resource amounts, ==0/!=1 tests, warning IDs and side-effect ordering remain.",
    "Native root has7 stack arguments, caller cleanup and logical void result. C status propagates only genuine checked child IDIV faults, not Native EAX/flags. Placement checks consume logical AL.",
    "Venue constructors use lastX/lastY. Housing retains whole-area entrypoint guard. Undo finish receives final costBC9728. Road-access4E2B10 is the last warning, with cached footprint.",
    "Actual callable terrain/monument-progress providers are required. No IL/image-token path or placeholder callback. Existing child producer-domain qualifications remain, including adjacent venue private-stack image history."
  ],
